gue: 0,0:03:31.05,0:03:32.21,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 0,0:03:31.05,0:03:32.21,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 0,0:03:31.05,0:03:32.21,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:34.55,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,AgeDialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:36.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Aokiji...Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Young fool!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:41.93,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He stopped it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:45.96,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,PDialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:45.96,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:45.96,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:46.51,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,ParDialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.31,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.31,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:46.75,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,tiDialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:46.55,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:46.55,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:46.55,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:47.14,Kuzan,,0,0,0,fx,sanDialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:15.40,Main,,0,0,0,,He froze the entire bay!Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:18.07,Main,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for the ships to move!Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:19.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Destroy the Moby Dick!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:28.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got some solid ground to stand on!Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:32.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Show them what we can do!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,The division commanders have joined the fight! Don't stop attacking!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,How nice of them to freeze the ocean!Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:47.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I was so fired up that it was getting too hot for me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:54.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Guess it won't be that easy...Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:04:59.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The vice admirals of Navy HQ are here, too!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:05.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many of the vice admirals together in one place!Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just like a Buster Call!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.99,0:05:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,But when they're up against the Old Man, or us, they're nothing special!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Tsuru-san, stand back!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:22.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, youngsters!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:28.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if I retreated to the ends of the sea, there's no such thing as a safe place anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.71,0:05:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Ground the ship on the frozen bay!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:35.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Take 'em all down!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:39.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Our destination is the bay! Advance!Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:42.35,Main,,0,0,0,,For the Old Man, I'd gladly sacrifice my own life!Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Navy HQ!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:48.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Squard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:55.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It has finally begun.Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:11.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this? You're gonna fight now?Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:14.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I merely wish to measure...Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:16.47,Main,,0,0,0,,to see for myself...Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,the true distance between us and that man.Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:31.19,Main,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Run away!Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Man!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He stopped it... The most powerful slash in the world!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The commander of the Third Division...Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Diamond Jozu!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:50.49,Main,,0,0,0,,K-Kizaru is here!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.41,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,m 4 48 l 28 41 l 55 56 l 69 49 l 77 33 l 70 49 l 86 40 l 103 43 l 86 41 l 55 57 l 41 49 l 25 60 l 40 49 l 28 42YaDialogue: 1,0:07:51.76,0:07:51.76,Borsalino,,0,0,0,fx,Y