ogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with his body?Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:54.49,Main,,0,0,0,,He took Kizaru-san's attack head-on, yet he's still alive!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.94,Main,,0,0,0,,His ability is as powerful as the rumors said!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:09:01.72,Main,,0,0,0,,A power even more rare than the Logia Fruits...Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:05.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The Mythical Zoan Type.Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! His wounds are disappearing!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:12.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this! How could that attack not work!?Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.52,Main,,0,0,0,,It still hurts.Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Liar.Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:36.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the First Division Commander!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:40.06,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what hits him, he recovers by flame...Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:42.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco the Phoenix!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a bird like this before...Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:03.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm... this really hurts.Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Liar!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Kizaru-san!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Giant unit! Watch out for attacks coming from the sky, too!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:26.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The Giants are coming!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Aim for their legs! Bring them down!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:36.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys, stand back!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:38.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Jozu!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What power!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:10.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Try stopping this!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a block of ice!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.27,0:11:18.56,Main,,0,0,0,,It's way too big!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I swear, those two are just...Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:24.81,Main,,0,0,0,,They simply went and left their stations!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:30.53,Main,,0,0,0,,If we're not here...Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,who will protect this area?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:12:02.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That enormous ice-block...Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:04.94,Main,,0,0,0,,He completely vaporized it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:09.09,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad!Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:13.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Volcanic rocks!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't let them hit us!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:19.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,One of our ships has been hit!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:27.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Get away from the ships!Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:41.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like watching the end of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.26,0:12:52.72,Main,,0,0,0,,These flames are too flashy.Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.35,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,GDialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.35,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.35,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.35,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.35,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:42.24,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,GreatDialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.04,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.04,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.04,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.04,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:42.59,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,ErupDialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:42.39,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:42.39,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:42.39,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:42.39,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.32,Sakazuki,,0,0,0,fx,tionDialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:13.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go light some candles on a birthday cake instead, magma-brat?Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:19.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't like flashy funerals, Whitebeard?Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Don't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:50.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:53.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Advance towards the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:11.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop the commanders!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let them reach the shore!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:17.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Sink the Moby Dick! Kill Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:39.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Break through the blockade of warships!Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:22.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Advance towards the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:09.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:13.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, go!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Little Oars Jr.!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:28.54,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the descendant of the Continent-Puller, Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:33.18,Main,,0,0,0,,He's enormous! Far larger than an ordinary Giant!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:37.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him into the bay! He's trying to breach our defenses!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:45.74,Main,,0,0,0,,So, Oars's descendant is one of Whitebeard's men?Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I want him! I want his corpse!Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get excited!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:02.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-kun is a nice guy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I ain't lettin' ya kill him!Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.76,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:26.86,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:00:24.72,0:00:25.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:00:24.72,0:00:25.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:24.72,0:00